{
  "_comment": "Copy this file to presets.json (same folder) to override or extend built-in presets per-install. Each entry may set 'runtime_force_noise_source' (CPU/GPU/NV/null) and an 'options' map of shared.opts keys to values. New preset names are appended to the radio choices.",
  "ComfyUI": {
